atrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\, \\\\ \\,3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\,\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311560 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "95d4b157-bf69-5bf7-9aad-3eba516db410" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}(7t)-3\\operatorname{sin}(7t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309947} {:answer/id #uuid "979f156d-01a6-59f8-8aca-1c984d058959" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\cos(7t)-3\\sin(7t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186506174}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\cos(7t)-3\\sin(7t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186506174} :answer-field/id #uuid "334b3886-7b34-5ba0-9e2a-91b524ea209a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310929} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "edb27977-979e-5d5d-9ca0-7fdf66c63c4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{sin}(7t)+3\\operatorname{cos}(7t)" :db/id #ed