 vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{-5t} & t{e}^{-5t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-5t}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{e}^{-5t} & t{e}^{-5t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-5t}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3t{e}^{-5t} \\\\ -3{e}^{-5t}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186372698 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd3a65fc-4bf8-52f4-ad48-b1d77f53af91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{sin}(6t)+3\\operatorname{cos}(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186372700} {:answer/id #uuid "4dc4a82a-36ee-5426-99eb-e3ffcb7ab6b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sin(6t)+3\\cos(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186445554}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sin(6t)+3\\cos(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186445554} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d23240b-1c76-53c1-a74c-bff1d5b80be5" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186372699} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "573d9cac-76d3-5ac7-8c30-2adbdb95893b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}(6t)-3\\operatorname{sin}(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186372702} {:answer/id #uuid "fbe8a58e-1762-5927-ad7d-8c11b3a901ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\cos(6t)-3\\sin(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186445593}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\cos(6t)-3\\sin(6t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186445593} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc61ae92-49a5-5ac1-a97b-53dc0941e692" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186372701}] :question/id #