rix ${A}^{T}\\,A$ is invertible. Therefore, multiplying by $({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}$ on the left, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\hat{x} & =({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}{A}^{T}b \\\\  & ={(\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix})}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -26\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 18\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -26\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{198}\\begin{bmatrix}18 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 11\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -26\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{198}\\begin{bmatrix}18 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 11\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482549 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0afb3631-bd9c-5f23-83f1-de3a65e2c41a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186481794} {:answer/id #uuid "2287b3ed-5a16-5b93-98d5-92c303dcba81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186481867} {:answer/id #uuid "389c2900-a592-57ae-bfa1-7bbef48b53d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186481915} {:answer/id #uuid "62a63059-3b74-51be-aa83-8b1410096d19" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482000} {:answer/id #uuid "dfe8354a-f4d5-505e-8c20-63690bd7fa8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{5} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218648